I always walk around this neighborhood hoping to find her....
A long time ago I lived near here and met a girl my age, I was fascinated. We lived many adventures, but my family moved to another city and I was never able to see her again.
Last year I was able to come back here with the hope of seeing her again... But... So far I never found her.
I feel a knot in my heart...

however... before I gave up, a miracle happened...

IT'S HER! Finally... I finally found her...

